    "output": "allowRead: [.../base, .../claude-501, \".../home/*/credentials\"]; profile contains (regex \"^.../home/[^/]*/credentials$\"); cat exit 0 stdout: SECRET. Control with the plain path: cat exit 1, 'Operation not permitted'."
